sequenceDiagram
    participant I as MCP Inspector
    participant M as Remote MCP server
    participant D as Descope

    I->>D: Authorize openid weather:read
    D-->>I: Access token with weather:read
    I->>M: get_weather
    M-->>I: 200 weather result

    I->>M: create_weather_alert
    M-->>I: 403 insufficient_scope<br/>scope="weather:read weather:alerts"

    I->>D: Reauthorize union of scopes
    D-->>I: Consent for weather:alerts
    D-->>I: Access token with both scopes

    I->>M: Retry create_weather_alert
    M-->>I: 200 alert created